## Why This Is Asked
This probes design of a CKNE-driven, live-traffic-aware scheduler at scale, with safe degradation and clear SLAs.

## Key Concepts
- CKNE-to-resource mapping: parallelism, window granularity, checkpoint cadence
- Minute-by-minute degradation loop with fairness guarantees
- Telemetry, preemption rules, and tenant isolation

## Code Example
